    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 BUG-09a: io-boundaries returns 0 boundaries for TypeScript repos despite extensive HTTP, fs, and subprocess use. workadventure agent simulation confirms this is the largest user-visible io-boundaries gap (Node.js + browser ecosystem). Add TS/JS I/O primitive YAML covering `fs.*`, `fetch`, `http.request`, `child_process.spawn/exec`, `WebSocket`, `process.env`, `console.*` (logging), `localStorage` (browser), etc. Per UAT: this unlocks taint-flow for the largest language ecosystem and is the highest-leverage io-boundaries fix."  # cb3a
